      "id": 489091,
      "username": "Malvin",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-12-17T15:33:56.332Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi.</p>\n<p>Make sure to verify the “-” character carefully, as it must be <strong>exactly the same</strong> for the system to recognize it correctly. There are three possible variants—<strong>long, medium, and short</strong>—which are often difficult to distinguish visually. Depending on the spreadsheet application and the device you are using, you may unintentionally be using a different dash character than the one expected by the system in the various “-” symbols required in the account.</p>\n<p>Often happens.</p>\n<p>Regards.</p>",
